license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Julia implementation and numerical research artifact for sparse temporal
  counterfactuals in mixed-integer planning models with fixed continuous recourse.
  Includes public-data provenance, numerical validation, and a separately
  implemented literature cost-constraint-generation comparator. The MIT license
  applies to original code; data and manuscript licensing are documented separately.
